title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/metarecord-list:apply
catalog: GUI command
target: metarecord-list:apply
summary: Metarecord list: apply a zone's content

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``metarecord-list`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply columns`` (while ``columns`` is focused)
* ``enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply finder`` (while ``finder`` is focused)
* ``enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply normal`` (while ``normal`` is focused)
* ``enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply simplified`` (while ``simplified`` is focused)
* ``shift+enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply columns stay`` (while ``columns`` is focused)
* ``shift+enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply finder stay`` (while ``finder`` is focused)
* ``shift+enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply normal stay`` (while ``normal`` is focused)
* ``shift+enter`` → ``metarecord-list:apply simplified stay`` (while ``simplified`` is focused)
